cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ilxyr in research, please cite the software and the exact archived release used."
title: "ilxyr: Intelligent Lab eXperiment Yielding Research"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: "ilxyr contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cenetex/ilXyr"
url: "https://cenetex.github.io/ilXyr/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  ilxyr is a local research control plane that freezes experiment contracts,
  gates execution, settles forecasts, and records content-addressed evidence.
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - experiment provenance
  - preregistration
  - research software
